                          Features in LogicBBS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

LogicBBS got several features which is of use both to user and SysOp.

 - Multitasking useraccount edit.

 - Server status for daily events, such as calls to the system, uploads &
   downloads during this day.

 - Quick icons at the top of a nodewindow.

 - Ability to run upto 33 nodes with one server.

 - Internal hydra transfer protocol (Bi-directional transfer)

 - Supporting Ami-Express 3.x / 4.x doors, both Arexx(AIM) and XIM doors.

 - Expanded error information messages to help the SysOp locate errors
   in system setup or config files.

 - Configuration files all made in ASCII code, for easier editing and changes

 - Node configuration can be altered without closing the whole bbs system.

 - Low memory requirements for normal system setup and can easily be reduced.

 - Very configurable setup.

 - Message base supports forwarding of mail, if user is temporary away,
   or sysop would like to forward message to another user on the system.

